{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午10時50分，警方接報上水清曉路一個地盤發生工業意外。據報一名工人遭鐵枝插傷下顎，繼而墮地。人員到場將他救起，送往沙田威爾斯醫院治理，案件列工業意外跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者送到沙田威爾斯醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192803670081671168239017.jpeg/9zt2KHZBG7dcDxpoIeBEek6OSuDBijCx_L43V_y-N1c\"/><figcaption>傷者送到沙田威爾斯醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:02:22.659614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:43:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:43.524625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:43.524625+00:00","content_hash":"2d5db0eeae4fe15e3bd0d1bec70fd80c8e9a776db80f5109e2a57fb4552fbe7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}